# Response headers for the published tree.
#
# Read by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages. NOT read by Caddy, which serves the
# current deployment at vaxbusters.org/qunilator — there the same headers are
# declared as `header_paths` on the vaxbusters.org static site in
# netzhansa-infra (roles/caddy, inventory/group_vars/all/main.yml). Keep the two
# in step; this file is what a move to a static host would carry.
#
# A board on an isolated LAN has no route to this site, but the operator's
# browser usually does — in that case the browser fetches the catalogue and posts
# what it got to the board. That only works cross-origin.
/catalog/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
